# Docker build-context exclusions (Phase 5, PLAN.md §11 / §4).
# Keeps dependency trees, virtualenvs, VCS/tooling metadata, secrets, and
# runtime data out of the build context and every image layer (ASVS V14).
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.next
.git
.planning
.claude
frontend/out
db/*.db
db/*.db-journal
.env
*.log
